<v Ira Glass>Then the guy writes back.

00:37:41.260 --> 00:38:00.730
<v Ken Erwin>So he said, hmm, interesting. I'm curious, how did you come to this conclusion? Which is a really good freaking question. So I said, ah, I found your address connected to the bot account on both receiving and sending funds. And then I added another smiley to keep it-- I didn't want him to think that I'm trying to threaten him or-- you know what I mean?

