00:40:26.570 --> 00:40:38.830
<v Ken Erwin>And looking through his stuff, I was like, this guy's got some good code. Like, just as a developer, he's a good dev, just super impressed. So for me, I don't know. He's like one of my people.

00:40:38.830 --> 00:40:45.870
