<v Adam McBride>They didn't buy enough of it.

00:43:34.110 --> 00:43:40.840
<v Ira Glass>So he made his best guess for PixelMap's price. And it worked out better than any NFT he's done before or since. People just went nuts.

00:43:40.840 --> 00:43:43.920
<v Adam McBride>Yeah, it was a rocket ship, a complete rocket ship.

00:43:43.920 --> 00:43:45.780
<v Ira Glass>How many tiles did you buy?

